referenceFunction.generalComment:
The raw materials per kg ready mix product are mixed in following ratio: sand: 0.888kg, organic binder: 0.110kg, solvents: 0.001kg, additives: 0.001kg. After mixing it is internally transported to the packing installation and packed. No direct process emissions are taken into account as they play a subordinate role compared to the emissions of the raw material production (e.g. drying of silica sand) and because no data are available. For inventoring the infrastructure, a yearly production amount of 150'000 tons  is assumed. The lifespan of the machines is assumed to be 20 years.;
Synonyms: Kunstharzputz; 
UUID: c3e545eb-3764-361e-97da-4fdd49abb8ac
